          "special": {
            "value": "You cannot select another dedication feat until you have gained two other feats from the Lion Blade archetype.\nLeads to: Expeditious Advance|LOWG, Flicker|LOWG, Lost in the Crowd|LOWG, Crowd Mastery|LOWG, Spy's Countermeasures|LOWG"
